      $G=frak(L)(CC)$ on the Lie algebra #L. Each $r$-chain of roots gives rise
      to a submodule of #L under $lr(⟨X_r,X_(-r)⟩)$ as follows. Let $s$ be a
      root linearly independent of $r$ which begins an $r$-chain. Let
    ]
